NDH-Constell# NDH‑Constellation Governance Spine v1.1 — Archived

This artifact has been archived following the activation of NDH‑Zen‑Bridge and
the release of NDH‑Constellation Governance Spine v1.2. It remains preserved as
a historical governance reference for the Inflection Point v1.1 era and must not
be used for active governance, runtime alignment, posture shaping, comparative
mapping, or ethical protection.

Successor: NDH-Constellation/governance/constellation_governance_v1.2.json


